          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abalakwa okhukhoma ikambi yabwe imbeli weshimenyo ebukwe, imbeli weliheema liokhwakaana aha eliuba lifwindilanga, bali Musa nende Haruni nabaanabe, abalindanga akabaleshelwa habundu ahatakatifu, akabaleshelwa khulwa abaana baIsiraeli; ne oundi yesi ousita ahambi, yeerwe bwirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
